<title>JAPAN: ASAHI CHEM SHARES RISE ON PATENT REVENUE REPORT.</title>
<headline>ASAHI CHEM SHARES RISE ON PATENT REVENUE REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Asahi Chemical Industry Co Ltd sharply gained ground on the Tokyo Stock Exchange's first section on Friday on a newspaper report that the company expects to earn more than 30 billion yen over the next 15 years from its patent on lithium-ion battery technology.</p>
<p>Asahi shares were up 17 yen at 614 yen as of 0101 GMT.</p>
